# NOTE:
# Initially, we planned to implement a Neuro SAN fallback chain. 
# However, due to network restrictions on Cognizant systems and API endpoints being blocked by Zscaler, 
# we were unable to access the required external LLM services.
# As a result, we adopted a simpler approach using the free-tier Gemini Flash model with minimal reasoning/thinking settings to optimize token consumption and stay within usage limits,according to Neuro SAN docs.